<a data-label=\"related_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/3438297/terry-town\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\" target=\"_blank\"><svg role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" aria-hidden stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lato\"><div class=\"header\" id=\"header\"><h1 class=\"game_title\" itemprop=\"name\">Terry Town Prototype</h1></div><div id=\"view_game_8354549\" class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget direct_download\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game</p><div class=\"direct_download_row\"><button class=\"button direct_download_btn\" type=\"button\"><svg role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" aria-hidden stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_download\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg> Download</button></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p>OUGH bit off a bit more than I could chew for the #lilguygamejam2025 but still wanted to share what I have done!! Welcome to Terrytown! All you can do right now is some basic building and watching your terries walk around lol, but I might develop this concept further in the future!! I&#x27;m happy with it even if it&#x27;s pretty small!!</p>\r\n<p>Controls:</p>\r\n<p>middle&nbsp;mouse&nbsp;drag&nbsp;or&nbsp;shift&nbsp;+&nbsp;right&nbsp;click&nbsp;to&nbsp;move</p>\r\n<p>mouse&nbsp;wheel&nbsp;or +/- keys to&nbsp;zoom</p><p><br></p>\r\n<p>If your terries get stuck somehow hover over them and click the unstuck button<br></p>\r\n<p>if anything breaks try saving and loading</p>\r\n<p>thanks for&nbsp;playing!!</p>\r\n<p>New stuff I learned from this jam:</p>\r\n<ul><li>finite state machines</li><li>grid building</li><li>astar pathfinding</li><li>random appearance generation</li><li>saving &amp; loading</li><li>godot node-based&nbsp;shaders\r\n</li></ul>\r\n<p>I like this project so I might want to continue it - lmk if you want to see more!</p><p>all art&nbsp;and&nbsp;coding&nbsp;by&nbsp;me</p><p>music&nbsp;from pixabay,&nbsp;sfx&nbsp;from&nbsp;freesound</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" version=\"1.1\" aria-hidden width=\"12\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_8693087\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/in-development\">In development</a></td></tr><tr><td>Author</td><td><a href=\"https://spencerj.itch.io\">SpencerJ</a></td></tr><tr><td>Genre</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/genre-simulation\">Simulation</a></td></tr><tr><td>Tags</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-city-